Help for ALLOWMAIL:

Registration is limited to email addresses in the domains set by
allowmail_domains in atheme.conf. ALLOWMAIL keeps a list of other
addresses that may register anyway, for alumni and guests.

The list is saved in the services database. Glob patterns work.

Syntax: ALLOWMAIL ADD <email> <reason>

Examples:
    /msg &nick& ALLOWMAIL ADD friend@gmail.com alum, class of 2024
    /msg &nick& ALLOWMAIL ADD *@lanecc.edu visiting from Lane

ALLOWMAIL DEL removes an address. Accounts it already made are kept.

Syntax: ALLOWMAIL DEL <email>

ALLOWMAIL LIST shows the domains and every address on the list.

Syntax: ALLOWMAIL LIST
